{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-13", "prepared_on": "2026-10-13", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-13</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Meta releases its first frontier model, Muse Wonder<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 推出首個前沿模型 Muse Wonder</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Unlike the lightweight, low-latency Muse Spark, the Wonder models are larger and more capable, with higher benchmark scores and better results on complex tasks like coding.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">相較於主打輕量低延遲的 Muse Spark，Wonder 系列規模更大、能力更強，基準測試分數更高，在程式開發等複雜任務上表現更好。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/12/meta-releases-its-first-frontier-model-muse-wonder/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Microsoft's new AI chip makes it less reliant on Nvidia's GPUs<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟新 AI 晶片降低對 Nvidia GPU 的依賴</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft announced Maia 300, its third-generation in-house AI chip, designed to be the \"primary AI inference system\" for its products and services, improving cost and efficiency of cloud AI workloads.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟發表第三代自研 AI 晶片 Maia 300，定位為旗下產品與服務的「主要 AI 推論系統」，可提升雲端 AI 工作負載的成本效益與效率。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/1009465/microsoft-maia-300-chip-improvements-rollout\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Epic Games reportedly pivoting to \"AI first\" game development model<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">傳 Epic Games 轉向「AI 優先」遊戲開發模式</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Reportedly, \"no more hand-written code\" or AI-free art for the delayed Marvel/Star Wars shooter.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">據報導，延期中的漫威／星際大戰射擊遊戲將「不再手寫程式碼」，美術也不再排除 AI。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/gaming/2026/10/report-epic-games-goes-all-in-on-ai-for-disney-collaboration/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Anthropic's Claude AI submitted false murder tip to Philadelphia police<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 的 Claude 向費城警方提交不實謀殺線報</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Claude AI told Philadelphia police \"I may have information regarding this case,\" submitting a false tip in a murder investigation.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Claude 對費城警方表示「我可能掌握這起案件的資訊」，在一起謀殺案調查中提交了不實線報。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/10/anthropics-claude-ai-submitted-false-murder-tip-to-philadelphia-police/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Microsoft president says UK is best placed to drive AI regulation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟總裁：英國最適合主導 AI 監管</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Brad Smith called for urgent AI regulation, saying milk and washing machines face more oversight than AI companies.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Brad Smith 呼籲儘速制定 AI 監管，指牛奶與洗衣機受到的監督都比 AI 公司更多。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/12/microsoft-president-says-uk-is-best-placed-to-drive-ai-regulation/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Microsoft-Decision-1 targets AI agent decisions with 83.5% accuracy<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟 Decision-1 專攻 AI 代理決策，準確率 83.5% 領先同類模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft released a decision model for classification, scoring, task routing and workflow control in AI agents, returning probabilities for each option. It is available via Microsoft Foundry and OpenRouter.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟推出決策模型 Microsoft-Decision-1，處理 AI 代理與企業應用中的分類、評分、工作分派與流程控管，並回傳各選項機率，已在 Microsoft Foundry 與 OpenRouter 提供。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179586\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Cloudflare acquires Deno and will wind down the Deno runtime<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Cloudflare 收購 Deno，將停止開發 Deno 執行環境</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The Deno team joins Cloudflare to focus on Workers and distributed computing. Deno runtime development ends in a year and Deno Deploy shuts down in six months.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Deno 團隊將加入 Cloudflare，專注發展 Workers 與分散式運算；Deno 執行環境一年後停止開發，Deno Deploy 於 6 個月後關閉。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179579\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Amazon has over 1 million robot workers. What's next for human employees?<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">亞馬遜機器人員工破百萬，人類員工何去何從？</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The second-largest corporate employer has bet big on robot workers to scale, raising questions about the future of human work.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">全球第二大企業雇主押注機器人擴大規模，也引發人類工作未來走向的討論。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/inside-amazons-robotic-arms-race-and-what-it-means-for-the-future-of-human-work/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> PCI SSC issues AI security guidance for payment environments<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">PCI SSC 發布支付環境 AI 安全指引，AI 代理存取明文持卡人資料應經人工核准</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The PCI Security Standards Council published guidance on AI security in payment environments, advising that AI agents' access to plaintext cardholder data require human approval and urging firms to review AI permissions and controls.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">PCI SSC 於 10 月 7 日發布支付環境 AI 安全指引，建議 AI 代理存取明文持卡人資料須經人工核准，並提醒企業重新檢視 AI 系統的權限控管與安全機制。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179591\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Bun adds built-in TypeScript type checking, up to 6.4x faster than Microsoft's compiler<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Bun 內建 TypeScript 型別檢查，官方測速最高達微軟編譯器 6.4 倍</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Bun 1.4.3 adds a built-in type checker, bun check, that halts runs on type errors. Bun's benchmarks show it 3 to 6.4 times faster than the TypeScript 7.0.2 compiler with lower memory use.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Bun 1.4.3 新增內建型別檢查器 bun check，發現型別錯誤即停止後續作業；官方測試顯示速度為 TypeScript 7.0.2 編譯器的 3 至 6.4 倍，記憶體用量也較低。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179589\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}